'''Neko Rin''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 592
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Neko Rin
|name2 = Neko Rin CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neko Rin CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Neko Rin should be used exclusively on stages with Dark enemies, otherwise her health is too low to tank other types of attacks. She can be used against some Dark enemies to tank them, with 30% dodge chance and 2 second duration, however due to most Dark enemies' very high damage with rapid attacks, unless you have good luck, she is rather useless. To further add on to that fact, [[Talents|Talented]] [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Flying Ninja Cat]] and [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] both outshine her as dodge-based meatshields because of their higher speed stats, much lower costs and cooldown times, and by having more than one target trait.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

